{"id":"modo","lemma":"modo","pos":"noun","rank":456,"glosses":["way, manner","mood"],"ipa":"/ˈmodo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"modos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-modo.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡De ningún modo!","en":"No way!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636824","words":[{"g":"of / from"},null,null]},{"text":"De todos modos, quiero verlo.","en":"In any case, I want to see it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152205","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"}]},{"text":"Me sentía del mismo modo.","en":"I felt the same way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/578470","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to feel","l":"sentir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"thereof"]]},{"text":"Es inteligente, pero de todos modos no me gusta.","en":"He's intelligent, but I still don't like him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608617","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"intelligent"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},null,{"g":"no / not"},null,null],"phrases":[[7,9,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"Yo hago las cosas a mi modo.","en":"I do things in my own way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594624","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}